Several enhancements can be incorporated into this project in the future.
1.	Distributed Generation Integration
Extend the optimization framework to include renewable distributed generators such as solar PV and wind energy systems.
2.	Renewable Energy Systems
Study network reconfiguration under varying renewable generation conditions.
3.	Real-Time Reconfiguration
Develop an online optimization framework capable of responding to changing load conditions.
4.	Smart Grid Applications
Integrate BOA with smart grid technologies, advanced metering infrastructure, and intelligent controllers.
5.	Electric Vehicle Charging Networks
Optimize distribution systems with high penetration of EV charging stations.
6.	Artificial Intelligence Integration
Combine BOA with Machine Learning or Deep Learning models for predictive and adaptive network reconfiguration.
